    "nextLabel": "1010001001312"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "茶色のハチマキ\r\n……？",
    "nextLabel": "1010001001313"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001001310030,
    "label": "1010001001311",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　私にとっては自慢の応援グッズです！\r\nこれ、とっても目立つんですよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100131/1010001001310030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001001310040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だからイベント会場でも、\r\n家族はすぐに見つけられるんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100131/1010001001310040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001001310050,
    "label": "1010001001312",
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ、そうなんです\r\n私のお仕事も、ずっと応援してくれてますし",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100131/1010001001310050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1010001001310060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だからもっと頑張って、家族にもっと\r\n喜んでもらいたいなって思ってます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/101000100131/1010001001310060"
  },
  {
